---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sola Hair Salon"
  description="How Sola Hair Salon handles data and privacy."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 prose-like">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm mb-6">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Overview</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      This site is a static, informational website. We aim to collect as little
      personal data as possible.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Calculators</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Our Salon Cost Calculator and Hair Length Calculator run entirely in your
      browser. Inputs you enter are not transmitted to or stored on our servers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Location Data</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Our "near me" search feature only accesses your device location if you
      explicitly click the relevant button and approve your browser's permission
      prompt. We do not store or transmit your precise location to our servers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      We may use privacy-conscious analytics to understand aggregate traffic
      patterns. If advertising (such as Google AdSense) is enabled in the future,
      third-party vendors may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this
      and other sites; you can control ad personalization through your browser and
      Google's Ads Settings.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
      Questions about this policy can be sent via our <a href="/contact/" class="text-rose-600 underline">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
